- nomenclature-wise: We have record, user, userRecord; we have associateUserWithCase but also upsertUserOnCaseRecords
  - I recommend userToCaseMapping: this makes it clear the things in the table are just mappings so that developers don't have to keep reminding themselves
  - I recommend we stick with plurals and remove singulars when both exist, e.g., upsertXs, associateUsersWithCase, etc.
- We have "createNewPractitionerUser" and "createUserRecord."
- I think I would love a single getUsers function that can take in docket number, email, id, role, section, maybe type, etc.
- I think I would like to update the 10502 followup and merge it into this branch.

